    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Hi! Where are you? I've been at the Museum Café for fifteen minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Hi! I'm at the Library Café. I think we've mixed something up."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Really? I was sure you said the museum. We met there last week."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "We were supposed to meet at the Library Café. My message said \"Library Café at six\". It's the one next to the City Library."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Oh, you're right. I can see it now. Sorry! So what should we do? The movie starts at seven thirty."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "The cafés are about twenty minutes apart. How far is the movie theater from you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "It's only ten minutes from here. From the library it's about fifteen."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Then I could walk to you now. I'd be there at about six thirty-five, so we'd still have time for a coffee."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That makes sense. I'll order for you. What would you like?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "A cappuccino, please. So, the Museum Café at about six thirty-five, then the movie at seven thirty."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "Perfect. See you soon. And sorry again!"
    }
